  "content": "<p>We got a new table saw and had the chance to test its additional safety feature, which helps prevent injuries from contact with body parts.</p><p>No wiener was seriously harmed in this experiment! We hope to integrate the saw into our current setup soon.</p><p><a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/hackerspace\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>hackerspace</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/makerspace\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>makerspace</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/openworkshop\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>openworkshop</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/MunichMakerLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MunichMakerLab</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/MuMaLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MuMaLab</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/Kreativquartier\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Kreativquartier</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/Kreativlabor\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Kreativlabor</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/DIYMunich\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>DIYMunich</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/sawstop\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>sawstop</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/tablesaw\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>tablesaw</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/safety\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>safety</span></a></p>",
